console.log("All whitespaces removed:", allWhitespacesRemoved);
```

### Java

In Java, to trim white spaces from both ends:

```java
public class TrimExample {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        // Original string
        String originalString = "  Hello, World!  ";

        // Trimming whitespace from both ends
        String trimmedString = originalString.trim();

        // To remove all white spaces (including in between)
        String allWhitespacesRemoved = originalString.replaceAll("\\s", "");

